+/* FUN_000bdef0 @ 0x000bdef0 — evaluate a script macro function and post its
+ * byte result back to the calling script thread.
+ *
+ * hs_macro_function_evaluate returns a POINTER to the evaluated result object
+ * (EAX; TEST EAX,EAX / JZ), or NULL when the evaluation yields no value. When
+ * non-NULL, the object's first byte (XOR EDX,EDX; MOV DL,[EAX]) is passed
+ * through FUN_000c95c0, whose AL return is zero-extended and returned to the
+ * thread via hs_return(thread_datum, value).
